{"unit_id":"H2CO3w__dsh-theme-frost#card-zh","repo":"H2CO3w/dsh-theme-frost","commit":"78e2886d305befe993679b81c76e1bf802c54b1d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-frost 是 DSH 网页客户端的壁纸与界面主题插件。它通过主机端路由提供状态和壁纸图片，并由浏览器模块将图片铺在页面背景、把官方配色的界面表面调整为半透明磨砂效果。深色和浅色模式可以分别选择壁纸、亮度与饱和度，也可调节模糊、主界面透明度和面板透明度。适合希望为 DSH 网页界面更换背景并保留官方配色风格的用户。使用时把图片放入插件的 wallpapers 目录并编辑 config.json；不需要额外配置或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60","lib/client.js:60"]}
{"unit_id":"H2CO3w__dsh-theme-frost#card-en","repo":"H2CO3w/dsh-theme-frost","commit":"78e2886d305befe993679b81c76e1bf802c54b1d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-theme-frost adds wallpaper and frosted surfaces to the DSH web UI. It serves local images and settings, and applies matching dark and light styles using the official palette. Adjust blur and opacity in config.json.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60","lib/client.js:60"]}
